ʼ","gloss":"contrite, destruction.","def":"crushed (literally powder, or figuratively, contrite)"},"H1796":{"lemma":"דֳּכִי","xlit":"dŏkîy","gloss":"wave.","def":"a dashing of surf"},"H1745":{"lemma":"דּוּמָה","xlit":"dûwmâh","gloss":"silence.","def":"silence; figuratively, death"},"H1749":{"lemma":"דּוֹנַג","xlit":"dôwnag","gloss":"wax.","def":"wax;"},"H1762":{"lemma":"דְּחִי","xlit":"dᵉchîy","gloss":"falling.","def":"a push, i.e. (by implication) a fall"},"H1717":{"lemma":"דַּד","xlit":"dad","gloss":"breast, teat.","def":"the breast (as the seat of love, or from its shape)"},"H1713":{"lemma":"דָּגַל","xlit":"dâgal","gloss":"(set up, with) banners, chiefest.","def":"to flaunt, i.e. raise a flag; figuratively, to be conspicuous"},"H1775":{"lemma":"דִּימוֹן","xlit":"Dîymôwn","gloss":"Dimon.","def":"Dimon, a place in Palestine"},"H1720":{"lemma":"דְּדָנִים","xlit":"Dᵉdânîym","gloss":"Dedanim.","def":"Dedanites, the descendants or inhabitants of Dedan"},"H1754":{"lemma":"דּוּר","xlit":"dûwr","gloss":"ball, turn, round about.","def":"a circle, ball or pile"},"H1707":{"lemma":"דַּבֶּשֶׁת","xlit":"dabbesheth","gloss":"hunch (of a camel).","def":"a sticky mass, i.e. the hump of acamel"},"H1716":{"lemma":"דָּגַר","xlit":"dâgar","gloss":"gather, sit.","def":"to brood over eggs or young"},"H1742":{"lemma":"דַּוָּי","xlit":"davvây","gloss":"faint.","def":"sick; figuratively, troubled"},"H1728":{"lemma":"דַּוָּג","xlit":"davvâg","gloss":"fisher.","def":"a fisherman"},"H1773":{"lemma":"דְּיוֹ","xlit":"dᵉyôw","gloss":"ink.","def":"ink"},"H1740":{"lemma":"דּוּחַ","xlit":"dûwach","gloss":"cast out, purge, wash.","def":"to thrust away; figuratively, to cleanse"},"H1748":{"lemma":"דּוּמָם","xlit":"dûwmâm","gloss":"dumb, silent, quietly wait.","def":"still; adverbially, silently"},"H1764":{"lemma":"דֹּחַן","xlit":"dôchan","gloss":"millet.","def":"millet"},"H1763":{"lemma":"דְּחַל","xlit":"dᵉchal","gloss":"make afraid, dreadful, fear, terrible.","def":"to slink, i.e. (by implication) t